:\\\"Article\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":3551,\\\"title\\\":\\\"SEC's Peirce tempers expectations over tokenized stocks exemption\\\",\\\"dek\\\":\\\"An executive at tokenization platforms Superstate said the stricter approach suggested by Hester Peirce would enable DeFi to expand without compromising rules in traditional capital markets.\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"secs-peirce-tempers-expectations-over-innovation-exemption-for-tokenized-stocks\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"contentType\\\":\\\"editorial\\\",\\\"publishedAt\\\":\\\"2026-05-22T05:35:38.704Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-05-22T05:35:41.213Z\\\",\\\"noindex\\\":false,\\\"cover\\\":{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\\u002Fmedia\\u002Farticle-covers\\u002Fhester-peirce-sec.jpg\\\",\\\"alt\\\":null,\\\"width\\\":1450,\\\"height\\\":966,\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"ArticleCover\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"id\\\":22,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Brayden Lindrea\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"brayden-lindrea\\\",\\\"positionLabel\\\":\\\"Staff Writer\\\",\\\"noindexPosts\\\":false,\\\"cover\\\":{\\\"url\\\":\\\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fs3-images.ctmedia.io\\u002Fmedia\\u002Fauthor-images\\u002Fauthor-1606-brayden-lindrea.jpg\\\",\\\"alt\\\":\\\"Brayden Lindrea\\\",\\\"width\\\":400,\\\"height\\\":400,\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"AuthorImage\\\"},\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"Author\\\"},\\\"category\\\":{\\\"id\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Latest News\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"latest-news\\\",\\\"folder\\\":\\\"news\\\",\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"Category\\\"},\\\"customAuthor\\\":null,\\\"__typename\\\":\\\"Article\\\"},{\\\"id\\\":3534,\\\"title\\\":\\\"Binance launches SpaceX-linked perpetual futures ahead of IPO\\\",\\\"dek\\\":\\\"The crypto exchange's new pre-IPO futures product lets traders speculate on SpaceX’s expected public market valuation before the company begins trading on public exchanges.\\\",\\\"slug\\\":\\\"binance-launches-spacex-linked-perpetual-futures-ahead-of-potential-ipo\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"published\\\",\\\"contentType\\\":\\\